{"type": "message", "id": "99a25f7e", "parentId": "1d3aa418", "timestamp": "2026-04-13T04:22:18.106Z", "message": {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_e543e519a17c4a7d847892", "toolName": "web_search", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\n  \"query\": \"EPA AirData Carbon Monoxide daily AQI Portland Vancouver Hillsboro OR WA Wichita KS San Diego Carlsbad CA 2000-2010\",\n  \"provider\": \"brave\",\n  \"count\": 5,\n  \"tookMs\": 954,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"brave\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"9a0b737b029f5a84\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nAbout AirData Reports | US EPA\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"9a0b737b029f5a84\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.epa.gov/outdoor-air-quality-data/about-airdata-reports\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3761ea002442f128\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nThe AirData Air Quality Index Summary Report displays an annual summary of Air Quality Index (AQI) values for counties or core based statistical areas (CBSA). Air Quality Index is an indicator of overall air quality, because it takes into account all of the criteria air pollutants measured within a geographic area.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3761ea002442f128\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"August 12, 2016\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.epa.gov\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1e742a49f51e78fc\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n2021 Oregon Annual Ambient Criteria Pollutant Air Monitoring Network Plan\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1e742a49f51e78fc\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://downloads.regulations.gov/EPA-R10-OAR-2022-0124-0017/content.pdf\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3b80506c7c8a241f\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nODEQ’s Air Quality Index (AQI) web pages. In particular, EPA encouraged states to use continuous · PM2.5 monitors instead of the filter base samplers which do not provide real time information. The · National Monitoring Strategy also created National Core (NCORE) sites which contain a wide array of · pollutant monitoring. ODEQ’s NCORE site has monitors for Carbon monoxide (CO), Nitrogen oxides\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3b80506c7c8a241f\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"downloads.regulations.gov\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"805b5c0982fff610\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nAirNow.gov\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"805b5c0982fff610\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.airnow.gov/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"dc32d6105c8dbe78\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nAirNow is your one-stop source for air quality data. Our recently redesigned site highlights air quality in your local area first, while still providing air quality information at state, national, and world views.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"dc32d6105c8dbe78\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.airnow.gov\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"44e03f6a13eb80c4\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nLocalAirData - Air Quality Information for Every US City\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"44e03f6a13eb80c4\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://localairdata.com/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"bbc41a90f535efd7\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nEPA annual AQI data from 2016–2025 lets you see long-term air quality trends, seasonal patterns, and year-over-year improvements or declines. ... Track PM2.5, PM10, Ozone, Carbon Monoxide, Nitrogen Dioxide, and Sulfur Dioxide — the six pollutants the EPA uses to calculate the Air Quality Index.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"bbc41a90f535efd7\\\">>>\",\n      \