{"type": "message", "id": "33f30252", "parentId": "273df7eb", "timestamp": "2026-04-13T04:24:04.709Z", "message": {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_a37e535732a54807a92790", "toolName": "web_search", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\n  \"query\": \"EPA AirData Carbon Monoxide daily AQI Portland Vancouver Hillsboro OR WA Wichita KS San Diego Carlsbad CA 2000-2010 annual report dataset download\",\n  \"provider\": \"brave\",\n  \"count\": 5,\n  \"tookMs\": 930,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"brave\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"10272fbccd6a71d9\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nAbout AirData Reports | US EPA\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"10272fbccd6a71d9\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.epa.gov/outdoor-air-quality-data/about-airdata-reports\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"97131694f0984123\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nThe AirData Air Quality Index Summary Report displays an annual summary of Air Quality Index (AQI) values for counties or core based statistical areas (CBSA). Air Quality Index is an indicator of overall air quality, because it takes into account all of the criteria air pollutants measured within a geographic area.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"97131694f0984123\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"August 12, 2016\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.epa.gov\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ea3b82efe47bc30a\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nAirData Basic Information | US EPA\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ea3b82efe47bc30a\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.epa.gov/outdoor-air-quality-data/airdata-basic-information\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"c89c64156d19e0ba\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n<strong>AirData lets